{"id":"A1-L040","title":"Subject + verb + object: use","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U03","focus":"Subject + verb + object — uso","targets":{"grammar":"Subject + verb + object — uso","pron":"/h/ de house","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["pasta","soda","meat","connect","sauce","meal","diet","vegetarian","allergy","spicy","bland","protein","fiber","calorie"],"field":"Alimentação","genre":"Blog, diário, crônica","skill":"Escrita","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 40 · Subject + verb + object: use","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Subject + verb + object — uso.","**Pronúncia:** /h/ de house.","**8 palavras novas** (alimentação).","**Texto do dia:** blog, diário, crônica."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo usar S+V+O em um blog sobre comida."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **escrever frases claras e corretas (IELTS Writing, TOEFL Writing)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["pasta","macarrão"],["soda","refrigerante"],["meat","carne"],["connect","conectar"],["sauce","sauce"],["meal","meal"],["diet","diet"],["vegetarian","vegetarian"],["allergy","allergy"],["spicy","spicy"],["bland","bland"],["protein","protein"],["fiber","fiber"],["calorie","calorie"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A blog post","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"My Food Diary","paras":["I **eat** an apple every morning. My mother **makes** soup, and my dad **cooks** pasta on Sunday.","We **don’t eat** meat on Friday. I **drink** water, not soda. My friends **ask** me for recipes!","Food **connects** us."],"kicker":"FOOD BLOG","by":"Ana","gloss":[["soup","sopa"],["pasta","macarrão"],["soda","refrigerante"],["connect","conectar"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Ana eats an apple every morning.","ans":"T","why":"“I eat an apple.”"},{"q":"Ana drinks soda.","ans":"F","why":"“water, not soda.”"},{"q":"Ana’s father cooks pasta.","ans":"T","why":"“my dad cooks pasta.”"},{"q":"Ana is a chef.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“connect” means…","opts":["conectar","cortar","quebrar"],"ans":0,"why":"connect = conectar."},{"q":"“soda” means…","opts":["refrigerante","suco","chá"],"ans":0,"why":"soda = refrigerante."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"S + V + O: use","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["S","V","O"],"rows":[["My mother","**makes**","soup"],["My dad","**cooks**","pasta"],["I","**drink**","water"]],"cap":"Frases de comida"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Objeto indireto","body":"**give / send / show** + pessoa + coisa: *She gives me a recipe.* (S + V + me + O)"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"My mother ___ soup. (make)","a":"makes","why":"mother → makes."},{"s":"I ___ water. (drink)","a":"drink","why":"I → drink."},{"s":"We ___ meat. (not eat)","a":"don’t eat","why":"we → don’t."},{"s":"Friends ___ me for recipes. (ask)","a":"ask","why":"friends → ask."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["soup","sopa"],["pasta","macarrão"],["soda","refrigerante"],["meat","carne"],["recipe","receita"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["eat","an","apple","I"],"ans":"I eat an apple","pt":"Como uma maçã."},{"words":["drink","soda","Do","you"],"ans":"Do you drink soda","pt":"Você bebe refrigerante?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"pasta","pos":"noun","pt":"macarrão","ex":"Pasta with cheese.","expt":"Macarrão com queijo."},{"w":"soda","pos":"noun","pt":"refrigerante","ex":"A cold soda.","expt":"Um refrigerante gelado."},{"w":"meat","pos":"noun","pt":"carne","ex":"No meat.","expt":"Sem carne."},{"w":"connect","pos":"verb","pt":"conectar","ex":"Food connects us.","expt":"A comida nos conecta."},{"w":"sauce","pos":"word","pt":"sauce","ex":"molho","expt":"A tomato sauce."},{"w":"meal","pos":"word","pt":"meal","ex":"refeição","expt":"A big meal."},{"w":"diet","pos":"word","pt":"diet","ex":"dieta","expt":"A healthy diet."},{"w":"vegetarian","pos":"word","pt":"vegetarian","ex":"vegetariano","expt":"She is vegetarian."},{"w":"allergy","pos":"word","pt":"allergy","ex":"alergia","expt":"A nut allergy."},{"w":"spicy","pos":"word","pt":"spicy","ex":"apimentado","expt":"A spicy sauce."},{"w":"bland","pos":"word","pt":"bland","ex":"insosso","expt":"A bland soup."},{"w":"protein","pos":"word","pt":"protein","ex":"proteína","expt":"Rich in protein."},{"w":"fiber","pos":"word","pt":"fiber","ex":"fibra","expt":"High fiber."},{"w":"calorie","pos":"word","pt":"calorie","ex":"caloria","expt":"Few calories."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**What do you eat for breakfast?** — O que você come no café?","**I eat an apple.** — Como uma maçã.","**Does your mom cook?** — Sua mãe cozinha?","**I’m on a diet.** — Estou de dieta.","**It’s delicious.** — Está delicioso.","**I’m allergic to nuts.** — Sou alérgico a nozes."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"enjoy","pt":"curtir","forms":[["I / you / we / they enjoy","I enjoy cooking."],["he / she / it enjoys","She enjoys pasta."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Food talk","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Food talk","lines":[["Leo","What do you eat for breakfast?","O que você come no café?"],["Ana","I eat an apple.","Como uma maçã."],["Leo","Does your mom cook?","Sua mãe cozinha?"],["Ana","Yes, she makes soup.","Sim, faz sopa."],["Leo","Do you drink soda?","Você bebe refrigerante?"],["Ana","No, I drink water.","Não, bebo água."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: /h/ de house","items":[{"label":"/h/ de house","note":"/h/ de house em how, have, help, her, him: sopro de ar.","words":["how","have","help","her","him","house"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you eat every day.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I eat an apple."},{"q":"Say what your parents cook.","pt":"Diga.","model":"My dad cooks pasta."},{"q":"Ask: Do you drink soda?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"Do you drink soda?"}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 5-sentence food diary.","model":"I eat an apple. My mother makes soup. My dad cooks pasta. I drink water. We share recipes.","checklist":["Usei **S+V+O**","Usei **-s**","Usei **uma negativa**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “soup” mean?","opts":["sopa","macarrão","carne"],"ans":0,"why":"**soup** = sopa."},{"q":"What does “pasta” mean?","opts":["refrigerante","macarrão","receita"],"ans":1,"why":"**pasta** = macarrão."},{"q":"What does “soda” mean?","opts":["carne","maçã","refrigerante"],"ans":2,"why":"**soda** = refrigerante."},{"q":"What does “meat” mean?","opts":["carne","receita","água"],"ans":0,"why":"**meat** = carne."},{"q":"Which is correct?","opts":["She cooks pasta.","She pasta cooks.","Cooks she pasta."],"ans":0,"why":"S+V+O."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Em **Writing**, diários mostram rotina com Present Simple.","Em **Speaking**, use detalhes (o quê, quem, quando)."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Peça um **diário alimentar** semanal.","Compare **S+V+O** em PT e EN.","Erro típico: omitir o objeto: *“I eat.”* → *I eat an apple.*"]}]}]}